[TITLE]
;;Project Title/Notes
Dynamic-wave geometry kernel parity (US units). A trunk backed up by a FIXED
outfall, a branch of drop manholes (invert offsets), an undersized branch that
surcharges and floods, a branch that stays dry, and small systems draining to a
FREE and a NORMAL outfall. G2 surcharges behind an undersized outlet and pushes
water back up CG1 into the drop manhole G1 (reverse flow over an invert offset).
CIRCULAR and RECT_CLOSED conduits, one barrel each.

